data: {"seq":1,"turn_id":"task_19b0d74f4b13f0b551fb0be4c7f30d7b","type":"turn_created","ts":"2026-11-26T18:19:45.058256+08:00","data":{"deep_research":false,"text":"# CSV 首条记录丢失\n\n`read_records(\"name,city\\nAda,London\\n\")` 应返回一条包含 Ada 和 London 的记录，目前返回空列表。修复 `records.py`，保留 CSV 的字段解析与记录顺序。只有表头时应返回空列表。\n\n任务工作区从 `repo/` 创建。验收测试由评测端保管。\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","turn_index":0},"internal":{"source":"host","type":"task_created","task_seq":1,"payload":{"text":"# CSV 首条记录丢失\n\n`read_records(\"name,city\\nAda,London\\n\")` 应返回一条包含 Ada 和 London 的记录，目前返回空列表。修复 `records.py`，保留 CSV 的字段解析与记录顺序。只有表头时应返回空列表。\n\n任务工作区从 `repo/` 创建。验收测试由评测端保管。\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","turn_index":0,"deep_research":false}}}

